{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "56197d2d5765b5e2178bfb6a8b9e0fcf289ba950226b1f0d4b729be52a078385", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\n志保はふわふわしたパジャマを着ることになった）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄中，\n志保要穿上软绵绵的睡衣）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "5d3d39610462a3cf118b903e6ff9f06604cc527f85c9fd1994e33b3274373286", "ja": "ふふ……。", "zh": "呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50335753ca9dc7a20820fc4bcab3895e31485a7f4ecf88ec1a0124e8043c0477", "ja": "志保、衣装が気になるなら言ってくれないか？\nさっきから何度も触ってるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "志保，要是衣服有什么让你在意的，可以跟我说哦？\n你刚才好像就摸了好多次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "c131ca2a590717eb8508b093105ed04265224097d174f98398efb72f4ec6ebd4", "ja": "あ、すみません……。\nふわふわした手触りが気持ちよくて、つい。", "zh": "啊，抱歉……  \n这种蓬松柔软的触感让人很舒服，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "4a828773a4eb6176f99f87637aa77306f89ac8b6d997ecee33efbe841f7f0187", "ja": "撮影前に触りすぎるのも、よくないですよね。\n気をつけます。", "zh": "拍摄前摸太多，也不太好吧。\n我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c5d33b930cfaa6d4396a1735f236a7fb95f418efa1ce7293777a275f62e94b72", "ja": "いや、不備があったわけじゃないならいいんだ。\nそれに触り心地がいいと、何度も触っちゃうよなぁ。", "zh": "没事，只要不是衣服有问题就不用在意。\n而且摸起来很舒服的话，确实会忍不住一直摸呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "05f97af5719450e6774a0fcafbff46a38c9dce632bd2a9ee423d6d8971c3b348", "ja": "そうですね、癖になるというか。\n軽くて、とても暖かいのも良いです。ただ……", "zh": "是啊，或者说，会让人上瘾吧。\n又轻又暖和，这点也很好。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1d1fbd711a69f70f11047f42db76b8b0d9870b78eacfff092cdb1b91565472d1", "ja": "ただ？", "zh": "只是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "acb8ae5deb049c206f5e602a9c84dbe36c0a51e04d87198fd5627db12f3f4028", "ja": "もこもこして暖かいのに、ショートパンツと\n組み合わせるのはどうなんだろうと思って。", "zh": "虽然毛茸茸的很暖和，但我在想，和短裤搭配是不是不太合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "c758ad7eb75802aaa539e0e3feb7733a32deb8420a23e080411c955e0b187c86", "ja": "機能性……暖かさを重視するなら、\n丈が短いのは矛盾しているような気がします。", "zh": "功能性……如果重视保暖的话，\n长度太短总觉得有些矛盾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1eb69071a40d9b32cd06ddce93e74266ac45410b662a12173aba5dab4a8ef107", "ja": "たしかにな……。\nでもパジャマって、それだけじゃないと思うんだ。", "zh": "确实如此……\n不过我觉得，睡衣可不只是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "6c1dfdda66c152424f18dbb6ab33a7fa17f2b64a0d914531611437e15596f74a", "ja": "どういうことですか？　あ……着心地という意味では\nずっと着ていても飽きないですね。", "zh": "你是什么意思？　啊……要说穿着感受的话，哪怕一直穿着也不会腻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d217be8d028c922440af5d6a51ea16331a093ad97139777344c256bbf5e1a37e", "ja": "そう、だな……。あとデザインとか！　可愛いパジャマ\nだと、寝るのが楽しみになったりしないか？", "zh": "对啊……还有设计之类的！穿上可爱的睡衣，不就会开始期待睡觉了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "20a48c5e3cab539b18ca47a041d9006bea770afa4e05b11557910e61ecaf1bec", "ja": "寝るのが楽しみに……\nまぁ、気持ちよく寝ることはできそうですね。", "zh": "期待睡觉么……\n不过，确实应该能睡得挺舒服的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1014_p", "source_sha256": "670501772c577ae5da814bbaea2371964a93acc1fee97c14dee6a68b6541f9c0", "ja": "そういうことじゃないんだけど……ま、いいや。\n気分良く寝られるのも、機能性なんじゃないかな？", "zh": "虽然不是这个意思……算了。\n能让人心情愉快地入睡，应该也算功能性吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "4fcc1a46d6e7c2edfefc9974be53d8c71c90ea7d6a42f213ea3c567af85aeb09", "ja": "なるほど……。毎日、寝る度に着るものだからこそ\n着る楽しみもあるのかも。", "zh": "原来如此……正因为每天睡觉时都会穿，或许也能享受穿上的乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "3b9345ca9f51aae525fff264c8bb6a887cebffeb1abfee8e3fecc02bffedda08", "ja": "ありがとうございます。このパジャマを\nどう見せればいいか、わかった気がします。", "zh": "谢谢。感觉我已经知道该怎么展示这套睡衣了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0463_1017_p", "source_sha256": "254024e4672d80c22756b4e7678e2bc8f44b0b6769548eb75e66da050b28afa3", "ja": "（本番では、夜のひと時を楽しむ志保の姿があった。\n撮影中も触るくらい、パジャマが気に入ったようだ）", "zh": "（正式拍摄时，志保展现出了享受夜晚时光的模样。看来她很喜欢这套睡衣，拍摄中也一直在抚摸它。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
